 ### Edge Cases and Pitfalls
-*   **Causality:** The predictor must only use previously processed voxels ($x-1, y, z$), ($x, y-1, z$), and ($x, y, z-1$). Using future voxels will cause encoder-decoder mismatch [S1, unofficial].
